MISSOURI QSO PARTY - for Missouri entrants: the 115 Missouri counties, 49 US states (not Missouri), DC as MD, the Canadian provinces and one DX multiplier
The counties come first, so a county code wins over a state alias spelled the same (MIS is Mississippi County)

INCLUDE FILE MISSOURI_CTY.DOM
Maryland includes the District of Columbia (sponsor's state table)
